  "contract": "Pierced 705033 reads 'Critical strikes with Skullpiercer and Precision Shot cause the enemy to bleed for an additional 15% damage of the damage dealt, plus an additional 35% over $782754d.' ($782754d = DurationIndex 35 = 4 sec). 705033's only effect is aura 354 (BasePoints 14 = 15%) with TriggerSpell 782754; the core has no handler for aura 354, so nothing ever happened. 782754 'Pierced' is a Physical bleed (Mechanic 15) SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE on the enemy with amplitude 2000 and SPELL_ATTR5_EXTRA_INITIAL_PERIOD, i.e. one tick on application and one at 2 and 4 sec, and it ignores caster and taken modifiers and cannot crit. Expected: without the talent a critical Skullpiercer applies no 782754; with it, a critical Skullpiercer applies 782754 owned by the Ranger, which ticks three times for 15% of the hit on application and 17.5% at each later tick, 50% of the hit in total (window 0.45-0.58: integer rounding, and room for the ~1.11 damage multiplier some fixtures carry, while excluding both no bleed and a doubled one). Instinctual Combatant 520572 (+100% critical chance on Skullpiercer, three charges) makes both Skullpiercers crit. Before the fix no 782754 ever appears.",
